OL,3,GNEWSA'My dying wish to get married is
OL,4,Acoming true'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA terminally ill man who is getting
OL,7,Fmarried on Saturday after a fundraising
OL,8,Fappeal, said he has been "blown away"
OL,9,Fby people's generosity.
OL,11,FLast September, music producer Antony
OL,12,F"Shorty" Shorter was diagnosed with
OL,13,Fstage four kidney cancer, which has
OL,14,Fsince spread to his lungs, back and
OL,15,Fshoulder.
OL,17,FThe appeal was organised by 18-year-old
OL,18,Fsinger Macy O'Neill, who performs as
OL,19,FMacy O, who is the daughter of his
OL,20,Fbride-to-be, Naomi.
