OL,3,GNEWSA'My dying wish to get married is
OL,4,Acoming true'
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said she wanted to help because he
OL,7,Fhad only been given months to live and
OL,8,Fthey had not been able to afford to get
OL,9,Fmarried because of his illness.
